Changes from Version 0.6 to 0.7.0 [October 23 2026]
* migrated from the R6-based RDML package to the S7-based RDML7 package
* added native RDML7 1.0.2 camelCase table support while retaining legacy aliases
* updated examples, demo applications, documentation, and vignettes for RDML7
* added integration tests for PCR plates, amplification curves, and AD plots
* fixed channel filtering in allelic discrimination plots
* corrected package dependency declarations and S3 method signatures for CRAN
Changes from Version 0.5 to 0.6 [November 05 2024]
* Cq and Tm on plots algorithm updated
Changes from Version 0.4 to 0.5 [September 26 2024]
* highlightings for plate and curves per creation added
* many things that I don't remember :)
Changes from Version 0.1 to 0.2 [August 02 2019]
* highlightings for plate and curves added
* return hover well position
